      "id": "set-concrete-type",
      "name": "SetConcreteType",
      "category": "DataflowConnection",
      "signature": "SetConcreteType(Target, In Type)",
      "params": [
        {
          "name": "Target",
          "type": "FDataflowConnection*"
        },
        {
          "name": "In Type",
          "type": "Name"
        }
      ],
      "returnType": "Bool",
      "docs": "Set the concrete type of an anytype connection\nChanging the type may fail or assert if :\n- the connection is connected to another one,\n- the type is incompatible with the original type\n- the type has any type dependencies connected\n- the type is locked ( see LockType() )\n(see IsSafeToTryChangingType)\n@return true if the type was effectivelly changed"
    },
