          "type": "FProperty*"
        }
      ],
      "returnType": "Name",
      "docs": "extract the type name from a FProperty\nthis method make sure the resulting typename is consistent with Dataflow standard where there's no space in the name\nfor example FProperty returns : \"TArray<TObjectPtr<UObject> >\" but dataflow compatible typename is \"TArray<TObjectPtr<UObject>>\""
